{"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Traffluent collects nothing on its own. It records only the events your app tracks and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"context your app turns on: every kind of automatic instrumentation and every standard enricher is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"opt in. It sends records only to the destinations your app gives a delivery, to endpoints your app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names. None of it is used for tracking as Apple defines it: no module links what it records with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other companies’ data, reads the advertising identifier, fingerprints the device, or works around","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the user’s consent or App Tracking Transparency. Every manifest declares ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyTracking"},{"text":" as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":" and lists no tracking domains.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each module that can produce data of one of Apple’s collected data types ships a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy"},{"type":"text","text":" declaring it. SwiftPM and Bazel both put it in a resource bundle named"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Traffluent_<Module>.bundle"},{"type":"text","text":", which Xcode and rules_apple copy into your app, where Xcode’s privacy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report finds it. A module your app doesn’t link adds nothing to the report."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Required-reason APIs","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Required-reason-APIs"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No Traffluent module calls an API on Apple’s list of required-reason APIs, so every manifest’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes"},{"type":"text","text":" is empty. The list’s categories are file timestamps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp"},{"type":"text","text":"), system boot time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategorySystemBootTime"},{"type":"text","text":"), disk space"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryDiskSpace"},{"type":"text","text":"), active keyboards"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryActiveKeyboards"},{"type":"text","text":") and user defaults"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":"). The modules that come nearest:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Module","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What it calls"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Why none is a required-reason API","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence","type":"reference"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"swift-system’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileDescriptor"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"open"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"read"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"write"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seek"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resize"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close"},{"type":"text","text":"), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fsync"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unlink"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileManager"},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setAttributes"},{"type":"text","text":" (the file protection class), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"contentsOfDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isExcludedFromBackup"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It reads no file’s timestamps, size from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stat"},{"type":"text","text":", or the volume’s free space: a segment’s size is the offset "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seek"},{"type":"text","text":" returns at its end, and the store bounds itself by the bytes it has written."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking","type":"reference"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"FileManager.fileExists","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Data(contentsOf:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Data.write(to:options:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"code":"FileVersionStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; ","type":"text"},{"code":"ProcessInfo.performExpiringActivity","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It reads and writes the version file’s contents, never its attributes.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","isActive":true}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"sysctlbyname","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"code":"hw.machine","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code"